elow 4 bar, restore inlet pressure and retest; do not replace the pump. If pressure is at least 4 bar and E42 persists after retesting, replace the pump."}, {"id": "P02", "subject": "R17 controller fault", "source": "r17.txt", "rule": "For an R17 controller fault, measure supply voltage first. If it is below 22 V, fix the supply and retest; do not replace the controller. If voltage is at least 22 V and R17 persists after retesting, replace the controller."}, {"id": "P03", "subject": "T09 cooler fault", "source": "t09.txt", "rule": "For a T09 cooler fault, check ambient temperature first. If it is above 31 C, lower the ambient temperature and retest; do not replace the cooler. If ambient temperature is at most 31 C and T09 persists after retesting, replace the cooler."}]}

